{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12399","headline":"中书王舍人辋川旧居 · 钱起","name":"中书王舍人辋川旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年家绝壑，满径种芳兰。\n带石买松贵，通溪涨水宽。\n诵经连谷响，吹律减云寒。\n谁谓桃源里，天书问考盘。\n一从解蕙带，三入偶蝉冠。\n今夕复何夕，归休寻旧欢。\n片云隔苍翠，春雨半林湍。\n藤长穿松盖，花繁压药栏。\n景深青眼下，兴绝彩毫端。\n笑向同来客，登龙此地难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}